  - key: menu.roadmap.items
    values:
    - "\"\\u2022 5,000+ Cards\\n\\u2022 Larger Play Area\\n\\u2022 More Card Categories\\n\\u2022 More Shelves & Storage\\n\\u2022 Additional Card Packs\\n\\u2022 More Graded Cards\\n\\u2022 New Rare Card Types\\n\\u2022 Skills & Upgrades\\n\\u2022 Achievements\\n\\u2022 Quality-of-Life Improvements\\n\\u2026and more!\""
    - "\"\\u2022 5.000+ Kart\\n\\u2022 Daha Geni\\u015F Oyun Alan\\u0131\\n\\u2022 Daha Fazla Kart Kategorisi\\n\\u2022 Daha Fazla Raf ve Depolama\\n\\u2022 Ek Kart Paketleri\\n\\u2022 Daha Fazla Dereceli Kart\\n\\u2022 Yeni Nadir Kart T\\xFCrleri\\n\\u2022 Yetenekler ve Geli\\u015Ftirmeler\\n\\u2022 Ba\\u015Far\\u0131mlar\\n\\u2022 Kullan\\u0131m Kolayl\\u0131\\u011F\\u0131 \\u0130yile\\u015Ftirmeleri\\n\\u2026ve daha fazlas\\u0131!\""
